  "created": "2026-06-09T11:14:23.843Z",
  "description": "On-device LLM inference for Circle. 1.5.0 adds ModelDownloadService.WriteInstalledManifestAsync — stamps installed.json into every downloaded bundle directory so ModelRegistryService.CheckForUpgradesAsync (1.5.0 in Core) can detect Version/SHA drift on later runs. Carries forward 1.4.1's KV-cache compression: KvCompressionMode wired through MNN's native TQ3/TQ4 attention quantization via the ATTENTION_OPTION runtime hint, plus the C++ TurboQuant codec port for parity testing. mnnbridge 1.2.0 native payload unchanged from 1.4.1 — 8 RIDs (win-x64, linux-x64, linux-arm64, osx-arm64, osx-x64, android-arm64, android-arm, ios-arm64).",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
